ound process.\\\"\",\n       :encoding-limit\n       \"the THEN also says to display results, log the activation history, and tune retrieval from hot/cold zones. The zaif arm set has no term for any of those, so this rule encodes the search clause only and the rest is unencodable rather than encoded.\",\n       :then-source\n       \"war-machine/ambient-pattern-retrieval.flexiarg:16-16\",\n       :rule :war-machine/ambient-pattern-retrieval,\n       :span-inside-the-then-block? true,\n       :pattern-id-matches-path? true,\n       :then-block [15 18],\n       :span-is-non-empty? true,\n       :counterfactual? false,\n       :file-exists? true}\n      {:encodes\n       \"\\\"Search once more against the installed source ... and look for an adapter to an existing theorem before building\\\"; \\\"Put exactly one `sorry` at the observed gap ... Beside that `sorry`, leave the consultation trail\\\"; \\\"stop researching once the misses repeat\\\"\",\n       :encoding-limit nil,\n       :then-source\n       \"math-strategy/missing-dependency-protocol.flexiarg:59-77\",\n       :rule :math-strategy/missing-dependency-protocol,\n       :span-inside-the-then-block? false,\n       :pattern-id-matches-path? true,\n       :then-block [59 79],\n       :span-is-non-empty? true,\n       :counterfactual? false,\n       :file-exists? true}\n      {:encodes\n       \"\\\"When budget nears exhaustion, force a decision: commit to best-so-far, escalate to a supervisor, or explicitly expand scope with justification.\\\"\",\n       :encoding-limit\n       \"the THEN offers three terminal choices -- commit to best-so-far, escalate to a supervisor, expand scope with justification -- and asks for reset rules. The zaif arm set has a term for none of the three: :yield is the nearest to `commit to best-so-far`, :ask is the nearest to `escalate`, and nothing expresses `expand scope`. The 102 recorded rounds also cross continuation boundaries this file does not reconstruct, so `rounds-so-far` is rounds since the turn began and not rounds since the current budget window opened.\",\n       :then-source \"agent/budget-bounds-exploration.flexiarg:19-19\",\n       :rule :agent/budget-bounds-exploration,\n       :span-inside-the-then-block? false,\n       :pattern-id-matches-path? true,\n       :then-block [20 23],\n       :span-is-non-empty? false,\n       :counterfactual? true,\n       :file-exists? true}\n      {:encodes\n       \"\\\"Treat 'pause and ask' as a first-class action with defined triggers: ... confidence below threshold, resource budget near exhaustion.\\\"\",\n       :encoding-limit\n       \"the THEN also requires the pause to carry a resumption payload (reason, missing info, requested decision, scope impact, confidence/budget snapshot). An arm choice carries none of that, so this rule encodes the trigger and not the payload.\",\n       :then-source \"agent/pause-is-not-failure.flexiarg:19-19\",\n       :rule :agent/pause-is-not-failure,\n       :span-inside-the-then-block? false,\n       :pattern-id-matches-path? true,\n       :then-block [20 23],\n       :span-is-non-empty? false,\n       :counterfactual? true,\n       :file-exists? true}\n      {:encodes\n       \"Apply update-mu using the post-step state when observation remains available.\",\n       :encoding-limit\n       \"The zaif arm set has no belief-update term; :act records only that the authored THEN calls for an update.\",\n       :then-source \"aif/status-gated-belief-update.flexiarg:26-30\",\n       :rule :aif/status-gated-belief-update,\n       :span-inside-the-then-block? true,\n       :pattern-id-matches-path? true,\n       :then-block [25 32],\n       :span-is-non-empty? true,\n       :counterfactual? false,\n       :file-exists? true}]},\n    :split-comparison\n    {:score-identical-to-that-arm? true,\n     :verdict-same-as-the-acting-order-arm? true,\n     :parent-arms-missing [],\n     :verdict-same-as-the-score-arm? true,\n     :construction-can-separate-them? true,\n     